| 1 | 58 bytes | 65,535 | 0.03s | +4 MB |
| 5 | 82 bytes | 327,675 | 0.17s | +16 MB |
| 100 | 652 bytes | 6,553,500 | 1.74s | +401 MB |
| 256 | 1,588 bytes | 16,776,960 | ~8s | OOM crash |
| 10000 | 60,052 bytes | 655,350,000 | - | OOM crash (4 GB+) |
